  "historyNote": "#2297, eff 2-7-83; ss by #2704, eff 5-9-84; ss by #4329, eff 10-20-87, (formerly Saf-S 1007.01) New. #4862, eff 7-10-90; ss by #5434, eff 7-8-92; amd by #6020, eff 4-14-95; ss by #6284, eff 7-10-96; ss by #7800, eff 12-11-02; amd by #8201, eff 11-9-04; ss by #9354-B, eff 1-3-09; ss by #10072, eff 1-11-12; ss by #10382, eff 7-23-13; amd by #10872, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 6-30-15, EXPIRED: 12-27-15 in para. (b)(15); amd by #11162, eff 8-22-16; ss by #12989, eff 2-5-20; ss by #13429-B, eff 8-6-22 (formerly Saf-C 307.01) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Pas 300); ss by #14144-B, eff 12-6-24, EXPIRES: 12-6-34",
